WEBVTT

00:10:30.625 --> 00:10:35.059
He said, "I am means."

00:10:35.083 --> 00:10:36.875
And there are only means.

00:10:37.917 --> 00:10:39.750
So I'm going to ask you one more time.

00:10:41.125 --> 00:10:44.434
Thank you for listening,
and please consider,

00:10:44.458 --> 00:10:45.934
for you,

00:10:45.958 --> 00:10:49.101
across the spectrum of your doing,

00:10:49.125 --> 00:10:50.726
how are you?

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.018
Thank you.

00:10:52.042 --> 00:10:56.125
(Applause)